markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Teaching about Bias

Discussing bias in AI can be complex and, at times, sensitive for students. These conversations are an important part of helping students think critically about technology and its impact, but they require thoughtful facilitation.

The following strategies can help guide these discussions in a way that is productive, inclusive, and grounded in learning.

<div style="max-width:900px; margin:20px auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; color:#292F36;">

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px;">

<!-- Card 1 -->
<div style="border:2px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(41,47,54,0.06);">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:8px;">Assume Bias</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;">
AI systems can reflect bias from their training data. Help students approach responses with curiosity and skepticism rather than immediate trust.
</div>
</div>

<!-- Card 2 -->
<div style="border:2px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(41,47,54,0.06);">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:8px;">Guide Thoughtful Discussion</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;">
Frame conversations around inquiry and exploration. Focus on understanding ideas, not assigning blame, and support respectful sharing of perspectives.
</div>
</div>

<!-- Card 3 -->
<div style="border:2px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(41,47,54,0.06);">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:8px;">Value Multiple Perspectives</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;">
Encourage students to consider different viewpoints. More perspectives lead to stronger understanding—both in AI outputs and classroom thinking.
</div>
</div>

<!-- Card 4 -->
<div style="border:2px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(41,47,54,0.06);">
<div style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:8px;">Promote Responsible Use</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;">
Support students in thinking about how AI tools are built and used. Reinforce evaluating outputs and making thoughtful, informed decisions.
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>

Addressing questions or concerns about AI bias—from students, families, or colleagues—can be challenging. Using structured prompts or discussion supports can help guide these conversations, clarify key ideas, and create a shared understanding.
MARKDOWN
